# kin/youth/wear/dress_hang: the youth girl's dress skirt from the waist to the ankles with A3's apron (cloth 3, pleated,
# its lower edge in shadow) over the front; the lit hem band and the dark under-edge, the shoe tips (legs tips) under it.
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b fix round 1). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Keys as robe_hang: rest (front and back: the bottom rows
# swing a pixel with the walk, sway 4), wide (the side walk's contact and down: the hem opens front and back), flare
# (the run), kneel (the fall's buckle: two rows shorter), lie (lying: the left view draped), sit and floor (postures).
# The apron's columns line up with the bib (dress.pxm) in every facing; the back shows the apron's tie strings.
# Motion fix round 3 (R3-06): the side (R, L) wide and flare keys (the side walk and run) end a row higher than rest, so
# the youth's thighs show under the hem (the tunic a lone hem row); the hang moves with the body on the down frames.
use person woman
body youth
role garment dress
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 4

